{"4243990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Path of Idle: Old Gods Rising","steam_appid":4243990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4985510,5473790],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/909013e883faee9bd18901b4b3dcf2ce.poster.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/909013e883faee9bd18901b4b3dcf2ce.webm?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/909013e883faee9bd18901b4b3dcf2ce.mp4?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeply integrated with the classic features of dark fantasy games, this title delivers a rich gear-building experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor-made for dark fantasy fans who are tired of intense mechanical operations, it lets you fully enjoy the fun of matching top-tier gear <strong>without tedious controls<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/240f19325595928b459fa07af5fc9b6c.poster.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/240f19325595928b459fa07af5fc9b6c.webm?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/240f19325595928b459fa07af5fc9b6c.mp4?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• You will serve as a servant of the Old God, building a town upon the sealed grounds of Blackreef Isle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Grow your cult, expand your influence, and choose those with hidden potential from exiled criminals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Awaken their power with the blood of the Old God, transforming them into Godsworn under your command.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Send the Godsworn to wage war across the world, growing stronger through slaughter and trials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  At last, step into the Void, defeat the mighty Outer Gods, and reclaim the sealed power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  When every seal is broken, the sleeping Old God shall rise from the depths of Blackreef Isle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Auto-Battle<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-auto real-time combat frees your hands completely—sit back and watch valuable loot fill your inventory effortlessly!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/c0631e41541e48ddc9eecb164840cbbc.poster.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/c0631e41541e48ddc9eecb164840cbbc.webm?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/c0631e41541e48ddc9eecb164840cbbc.mp4?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Unique Classes<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class boasts an exclusive and one-of-a-kind skill system. Smartly combine skills to unleash devastating combat power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/e3cee2962bb51344dae09a915d0b39c2.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=384 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Gear System<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inheriting the essence of multiple dark fantasy games, gears of different rarities each serve a distinct purpose, enabling countless build possibilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/4b41404be1c557b745ba98f69db404d2.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=282 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town Construction &amp; Upgrade<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of town buildings offer rich functional services. Customize upgrades at will to greatly enhance building efficiency.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Gameplay Modes<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five adventure modes—Expedition, Exploration, Divine Tower, Alternate Dimension, and Finality—unfold in a layered progression, bringing diverse challenge experiences.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Seasonal Challenges (Seasonal content will be gradually added after the launch)<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season features unique new content with independent save files. You can embark on any seasonal journey at any time.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/909013e883faee9bd18901b4b3dcf2ce.poster.avi