 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Send the Godsworn to wage war across the world, growing stronger through slaughter and trials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  At last, step into the Void, defeat the mighty Outer Gods, and reclaim the sealed power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  When every seal is broken, the sleeping Old God shall rise from the depths of Blackreef Isle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Auto-Battle<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-auto real-time combat frees your hands completely—sit back and watch valuable loot fill your inventory effortlessly!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/c0631e41541e48ddc9eecb164840cbbc.poster.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/c0631e41541e48ddc9eecb164840cbbc.webm?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/c0631e41541e48ddc9eecb164840cbbc.mp4?t=1792490557\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Unique Classes<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class boasts an exclusive and one-of-a-kind skill system. Smartly combine skills to unleash devastating combat power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4243990\/extras\/e3cee2962bb51344dae09a915d0b39c2.avif?t=1792490557\" width=780 height=384 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Gear System<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inheriting the 